# Docker build-context filter (repository root).
#
# The only build that uses the repository root as its context is docker/fuseki/
# (see docker/fuseki/Dockerfile) — it needs just domox-domain/src/main/resources/.
# The per-service Dockerfiles under docker/*/ build from their own directory and are
# unaffected by this file.  Excluding the heavy, regenerated directories keeps the
# context a few MB instead of the ~850 MB a full working copy weighs.

.git
.github
**/target
**/node_modules
venv
.idea
*.iml
